{"title":"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">2006 AMC 12A #10</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">2006 AMC 10A #10</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db0049153e9c1ac17559a4ceb2ac241831348145.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{120-\\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"93\" height=\"32\" /> an integer?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42cc75986af98311237a654fe24b8c759490665d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 3\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 6\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 9\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 10\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }  11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db0049153e9c1ac17559a4ceb2ac241831348145.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{120-\\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"93\" height=\"32\" /> to be an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/90021bd49986a0cab054f7e994fc8f8e7208e16e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120-\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" /> must be a perfect square. \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/0/4805dddb4e6911989af8be91da334b5ba2054757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> can't be negative, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/1743e3ee89a3654ce18ea60e51c41c5ddc94c057.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120-\\sqrt{x} \\leq 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>The perfect squares that are less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5868916d3b634f8be95d1a59b76f502f4bcc7fed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{0,1,4,9,16,25,36,49,64,81,100\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"270\" height=\"18\" />, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/90021bd49986a0cab054f7e994fc8f8e7208e16e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120-\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>Since every value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/90021bd49986a0cab054f7e994fc8f8e7208e16e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120-\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" /> gives one and only one possible value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, the number of values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18e8197c1f407d14348beed1a2dfa72335b8355c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A\">2006 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\